* Speak with Cid as a {p:Dark Knight} to begin quest.

>**You can be on any job from here on.**
* Obtain a {i:Darksteel Ingot|Darksteel Ingot|654} from the Auction House or Crafting.
** One is enough for multiple people doing the quest.
* Zone into {z:Ordelle's Caves} for a cutscene.
** Survival guide and voidwatch warp bring you to the same entrance.
* Trade the Darksteel Ingot to the ??? at (I-8) on map 1 to spawn {m:Gerwitz's Axe (NM)}.
