** If you are defeated you will need another {i:Darksteel Ingot|Darksteel Ingot|654} to respawn the NM.
* Head South up the ramp (D on the wiki maps). At (H-11/12) drop down the hole (the southeast hole). Go east to reach map 3 (E on the wiki maps).
* Trade Gerwitz's Axe to the ??? at (H-8) on map 3 to spawn {m:Gerwitz's Sword (NM)}.
* Defeat Gerwitz's Sword and it will drop {p:Gerwitz's Sword}.
* Head South to enter a large square room.
* Trade Gerwitz's Sword to the ??? at (H-10) and it will spawn {m:Gerwitz's Soul}.
* Defeat Gerwitz's Soul then head for {z:La Theine Plateau} at (G-10) on the same map. You will receive your reward after the cutscene.
** All party members in zone receive credit for Gerwitz's Soul's defeat for quest progression even if they are too far to gain exp.

